OL,3,GNEWSAHeroin and cocaine drug gang
OL,4,Ahanded jail sentences
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a county lines drugs gang
OL,7,Fwho brought "misery to the streets of
OL,8,FDerby" by supplying heroin and crack
OL,9,Fcocaine have been handed jail
OL,10,Fsentences.
OL,12,FDerbyshire Police said Operation Birnam
OL,13,F- which was part of an investigation
OL,14,Finto the "M/Emz" county line drug
OL,15,Fdealing operation - found Millen
OL,16,FO'Donnell was supplying drugs in Derby
OL,17,Fand Amber Valley.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
