OL,3,GNEWSAHeroin and cocaine drug gang
OL,4,Ahanded jail sentences
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Donnell was identified as the main
OL,7,Fcontroller of the gang, while Jonathan
OL,8,FWilson, Rosco Cyster, Daryl Hudson and
OL,9,FMark Carlin were drug runners, police
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAll five men pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Fconspiracy to supply heroin and crack
OL,14,Fcocaine between 1 March 2025 and 27
OL,15,FJanuary this year, and were handed jail
OL,16,Fterms at Derby Crown Court.
